{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "依次取出每个字符串，将字符排序后得到统一的分组键；字母异位词的排序结果必然相同。用哈希表把原字符串追加到对应键的桶中，遍历结束后取出所有桶即可。设字符串数量为 n、最大长度为 k，时间复杂度为 O(n·k log k)，空间复杂度为 O(n·k)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>字母异位词分组</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{width:100%;margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}body{overflow:auto}main.app{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.title{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}.title strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.status{color:#3794ff;font-size:12px}.input{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.word,.key,.chip{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}.word{padding:4px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;transition:.35s}.word.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.word.done{border-color:#3794ff}.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:48px}.box{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;text-align:center;font-size:12px}.arrow{color:#3794ff;font-size:14px}.key{color:#d4d4d4;font-size:13px}.buckets{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:8px}.bucket{min-height:64px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;transition:.35s}.bucket.flash{border-color:#3794ff}.bucket-head{color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px}.chips{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}.chip{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#d4d4d4;font-size:12px}.chip.new{background:#0e639c;color:#fff;border-color:#3794ff;animation:pop .45s ease}.hint{color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.45;font-size:12px}@keyframes pop{0%{opacity:0;transform:scale(.65)}100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"title\"><strong>排序键 → 哈希分组</strong><span class=\"status\" id=\"status\">准备开始</span></div>\n  <section class=\"input\" id=\"input\"></section>\n  <section class=\"flow\">\n    <div class=\"box\">当前字符串<br><span class=\"key\" id=\"current\">—</span></div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n    <div class=\"box\">字符排序得到键<br><span class=\"key\" id=\"sorted\">—</span></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"buckets\" id=\"buckets\"></section>\n  <div class=\"hint\">相同排序键进入同一个桶；桶中的原字符串就是一组字母异位词。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst words=['eat','tea','tan','ate','nat','bat'];\nconst keys=[...new Set(words.map(w=>[...w].sort().join('')))];\nconst input=document.getElementById('input'),buckets=document.getElementById('buckets');\nwords.forEach((w,i)=>{const e=document.createElement('span');e.className='word';e.textContent='\"'+w+'\"';e.id='w'+i;input.appendChild(e)});\nkeys.forEach(k=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='bucket';e.id='b'+k;e.innerHTML='<div class=\"bucket-head\">键：<span class=\"key\">'+k+'</span></div><div class=\"chips\"></div>';buckets.appendChild(e)});\nlet step=-1,timer;\nfunction reset(){step=-1;document.querySelectorAll('.word').forEach(e=>e.className='word');document.querySelectorAll('.chips').forEach(e=>e.innerHTML='');document.querySelectorAll('.bucket').forEach(e=>e.classList.remove('flash'));document.getElementById('current').textContent='—';document.getElementById('sorted').textContent='—';document.getElementById('status').textContent='准备开始'}\nfunction advance(){step++;if(step>=words.length){document.getElementById('status').textContent='分组完成，稍后重播';document.getElementById('current').textContent='完成';document.getElementById('sorted').textContent='3 个分组';document.querySelectorAll('.word').forEach(e=>e.classList.remove('active'));clearInterval(timer);setTimeout(()=>{reset();timer=setInterval(advance,1200)},2200);return}document.querySelectorAll('.word').forEach(e=>e.classList.remove('active'));document.querySelectorAll('.bucket').forEach(e=>e.classList.remove('flash'));const w=words[step],k=[...w].sort().join('');const word=document.getElementById('w'+step),bucket=document.getElementById('b'+k);word.classList.add('active','done');bucket.classList.add('flash');document.getElementById('current').textContent=w;document.getElementById('sorted').textContent=k;document.getElementById('status').textContent='处理第 '+(step+1)+' / '+words.length+' 个';const chip=document.createElement('span');chip.className='chip new';chip.textContent=w;bucket.querySelector('.chips').appendChild(chip)}\nsetTimeout(()=>{advance();timer=setInterval(advance,1200)},700);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n·k log(k+1)), 平均",
  "space_complexity": "O(n·k)",
  "complexity_note": "n 为字符串数量, k 为最大字符串长度与 1 的较大值, 用于覆盖空字符串. 每个字符串排序后作为哈希键, 哈希操作按平均情况计; 保存排序键与分组占 O(n·k)."
}
